From: ss3ds <ss3ds@localhost>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 14:27:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ss3ds: seed the Safari Zone area customizer and decoration
 screens (overlay 108)

Both editors are launched only through overlay templates, so the translator never rooted them and opening either screen aborted with [SS-MISSING]. Seed the two overlay 108 files (as 0263 did for its apps) and drop the six matching Missing() stubs. Static check: all 154 functions translate, the closure adds only overlay 108 functions, and every new external (26) is a C function already in the decomp or the SDK libraries. Not yet compiled or run on device.
---
 port/soulsilver-native-core/nitromain-perf/missing.c  | 6 ------
 port/soulsilver-native-play/maploader/seed-files.json | 4 +++-
 2 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/port/soulsilver-native-core/nitromain-perf/missing.c b/port/soulsilver-native-core/nitromain-perf/missing.c
index 9e4e7db..c7178b7 100644
--- a/port/soulsilver-native-core/nitromain-perf/missing.c
+++ b/port/soulsilver-native-core/nitromain-perf/missing.c
@@ -156,12 +156,6 @@ __attribute__((noreturn)) void NintendoWfc_Init(void){Missing("NintendoWfc_Init"
 __attribute__((noreturn)) void NintendoWfc_Main(void){Missing("NintendoWfc_Main");}
 __attribute__((noreturn)) void PmAgbCartridge_GetLanguage(void){Missing("PmAgbCartridge_GetLanguage");}
 __attribute__((noreturn)) void PmAgbCartridge_GetVersionInternal(void){Missing("PmAgbCartridge_GetVersionInternal");}
-__attribute__((noreturn)) void SafariAreaCustomizer_Exit(void){Missing("SafariAreaCustomizer_Exit");}
-__attribute__((noreturn)) void SafariAreaCustomizer_Init(void){Missing("SafariAreaCustomizer_Init");}
-__attribute__((noreturn)) void SafariAreaCustomizer_Main(void){Missing("SafariAreaCustomizer_Main");}
-__attribute__((noreturn)) void SafariDecoration_Exit(void){Missing("SafariDecoration_Exit");}
-__attribute__((noreturn)) void SafariDecoration_Init(void){Missing("SafariDecoration_Init");}
-__attribute__((noreturn)) void SafariDecoration_Main(void){Missing("SafariDecoration_Main");}
 
 
 
